#: ../installation/update.rst:5
#: c4a0150d911747f9850844fb561daa56
msgid "Updating"
msgstr "Posodabljanje"

#: ../installation/update.rst:7
#: 85c8c8a096ee48a2bf0c808fa88789f9
msgid "If you are using an old Galette release, it's time to update."
msgstr "Če uporabljate staro izdajo Galette, je čas za posodobitev."

#: ../installation/update.rst:11
#: 8f2753c896f64b7bb6c50fdc0cfbd460
msgid "An update is often not something lite, your data may be modified. So, please make sure you made **a backup of your current database**, or you may lost all or a part of your data."
msgstr ""
"Posodobitev pogosto ni nekaj lahkega, vaši podatki se lahko spremenijo. Zato "
"poskrbite, da ste naredili **varnostno kopijo trenutne baze podatkov**, "
"sicer lahko izgubite vse ali del svojih podatkov."

#: ../installation/update.rst:13
#: 0ce3fcfa5743401f903cb46007cc96d3
msgid "A backup of all Galette files is also recommended it would be helpful if you find a bug that prevent you to migrate and have to restore an old version;"
msgstr ""
"Priporočljiva je tudi varnostna kopija vseh datotek Galette, kar bi bilo "
"koristno, če bi odkrili napako, ki vam preprečuje selitev in morate obnoviti "
"staro različico;"

#: ../installation/update.rst:17
#: b770437d655d45a5873376dab5ea469a
msgid "Migrating a pre 0.7 release is theoretically supported, but this is not tested (those releases are more than 10 years old!), and it is possible your attempt fail."
msgstr ""
"Selitev izdaje pred različico 0.7 je teoretično podprta, vendar to ni "
"preizkušeno (te izdaje so starejše od 10 let!) in je možno, da vaš poskus ne "
"bo uspel."

#: ../installation/update.rst:19
#: c28f7153bc7c49cc80588d2cb53cbfcc
msgid "Nothing is really made to make such a time travel ;) If this is your case, you should first `migrate to Galette 0.7.8 <https://galette.eu/download/archives/galette-0.7.8.tar.bz2>`_; and do another migration to the latest version."
msgstr ""
"Nič ni res narejeno za takšno potovanje skozi čas ;) Če je to vaš primer, "
"morate najprej `preseliti na Galette 0.7.8 <https://galette.eu/download/"
"archives/galette-0.7.8.tar.bz2>`_; in nato še enkrat na najnovejšo različico."

#: ../installation/update.rst:22
#: ddeccd27b1d24d1fa7bc1e6121cd20f1
msgid "Updating files"
msgstr "Posodabljanje datotek"

#: ../installation/update.rst:24
#: b2893b3c6eaa42f5851407515c09fa7b
msgid "First, logout from your instance, and make sure to use a maintenance mode to prevent other users to reach the instance."
msgstr ""
"Najprej se odjavite iz svojega primerka in se prepričajte, da uporabljate "
"vzdrževalni način, da preprečite drugim uporabnikom dostop do primerka."

#: ../installation/update.rst:26
#: aceb420907fd4016ab8456495e0057dd
msgid "Then, download latest Galette version and replace the files. For more information on files installation, refer to the :ref:`prepare installation <preparation>` section."
msgstr ""
"Nato prenesite najnovejšo različico Galette in zamenjajte datoteke. Za več "
"informacij o namestitvi datotek glejte razdelek :ref:`prepare installation "
"<preparation>`."

#: ../installation/update.rst:28
#: ce34ab9888eb41309710dc28ae856a61
msgid "Some directories keep data and/or configurations and should be copied back to the new instance:"
msgstr ""
"Nekateri imeniki hranijo podatke in/ali konfiguracije in jih je treba "
"kopirati nazaj v novo instanco:"

#: ../installation/update.rst:30
#: 0613607a643341638af2ca989c052877
msgid "``config/config.inc.php``. If this file is missing, Galette update process will ask you the information and create a new one. If the file is present, it will be used to fill information excepted database password. It is the only file that can be edited during update process,"
msgstr ""
"``config/config.inc.php``. Če te datoteke ni, vas bo postopek posodabljanja "
"Galette vprašal za podatke in ustvaril novo. Če je datoteka prisotna, bo "
"uporabljena za vnos podatkov, razen gesla baze podatkov. To je edina "
"datoteka, ki jo je mogoče urejati med postopkom posodabljanja,"

#: ../installation/update.rst:31
#: 59761ec82cf74838a2db9a5cc53387dd
msgid "``data/photos`` your members photos and logos,"
msgstr "``data/photos`` fotografije in logotipi vaših članov,"

#: ../installation/update.rst:32
#: 0ca3359130544cfcacb40341ff080017
msgid "``data/exports`` contains CSv exports,"
msgstr "``data/exports`` vsebuje izvoze CSV,"

#: ../installation/update.rst:33
#: 97ca05c6a7a245f391d2ed8fdad9594b
msgid "``data/files`` contains files from dynamic fields of type file,"
msgstr "``data/files`` vsebuje datoteke iz dinamičnih polj tipa file,"

#: ../installation/update.rst:34
#: 17dae2c5a3f743629de6c20ace036605
msgid "``data/attachments`` contains mailing attached documents."
msgstr ""
"``data/attachments`` vsebuje priložene dokumente za pošiljanje po pošti."

#: ../installation/update.rst:35
#: e80f2ec427564a80aad7a5fad00df093
msgid "``plugins`` your current plugins. It is a good idea to check if new plugins versions are available ;)"
msgstr ""
"``plugins`` vaši trenutni vtičniki. Priporočljivo je preveriti, ali so na "
"voljo nove različice vtičnikov ;)"

#: ../installation/update.rst:37
#: 759c2d7bade247e5959b28f4bb1730ea
msgid "Once files are updated, go to your Galette instance. It will ask you if needed to proceed to the update of your database."
msgstr ""
"Ko so datoteke posodobljene, pojdite v svojo instanco Galette. Vprašal vas "
"bo, ali je treba nadaljevati s posodobitvijo baze podatkov."

#: ../installation/update.rst:39
#: b50f3746516d4b25b9016c563270c20d
msgid "If so, visit the install URL ``/installer.php`` (ex: https://your.domain.name/installer.php) and choose *Update* when your are asked for the type of installation."
msgstr ""
"Če je tako, obiščite namestitveni URL ``/installer.php`` (npr.: https://"
"vaša.domena/installer.php) in izberite *Posodobi*, ko vas sistem vpraša po "
"vrsti namestitve."

#: ../installation/update.rst:41
#: acbdab0cec644716ba93b2b5534113dd
msgid "If it asks you nothing you're just done already ;)"
msgstr "Če te nič ne vpraša, si že končal ;)"

#: ../installation/update.rst:45
#: 4b6889058e484a889fe18f9a3afa4a78
msgid "Updating database"
msgstr "Posodabljanje baze podatkov"

#: ../installation/update.rst:49
#: 621d9cdcb39d49a99b7e21bb86741bba
msgid "Installing a new Galette release does not strictly means a database update will be required! Sometimes, only updating the files will be enough; even for a major release."
msgstr ""
"Namestitev nove izdaje Galette ne pomeni nujno, da bo potrebna posodobitev "
"baze podatkov! Včasih je dovolj le posodobitev datotek; tudi pri večji "
"izdaji."

#: ../installation/update.rst:51
#: 37b53ace7af742b3986e4f751629065d
msgid "Galette will tell you if an update is needed, no need to \"force\" an update."
msgstr ""
"Galette vam bo povedal, če je potrebna posodobitev, ni vam treba \"force\" "
"posodobitve."

#: ../installation/update.rst:53
#: 8900502e7ad444ccb72966ba1fdb29a1
msgid "Update process is very similar to :doc:`Galette installation process <galette>`, with some steps that change. All is mostly transparent, information are provided on each step."
msgstr ""
"Postopek posodabljanja je zelo podoben :doc:`postopku namestitve Galette "
"<galette>`, z nekaj spremembami v korakih. Vse je večinoma pregledno, "
"informacije so podane za vsak korak."

#: ../installation/update.rst:56
#: e946375277c34dbfa2f2bb7f268a7351
msgid "Database information"
msgstr "Informacije o zbirki podatkov"

#: ../installation/update.rst:58
#: 51ca20b11982427eaee8756abe020978
msgid "At \"Installation type\" step, you'll have to choose \"update\". Database information page will be pre filled with existing information, excepting password. Other information should not be changed."
msgstr ""
"V koraku »Vrsta namestitve« boste morali izbrati »posodobi«. Stran s podatki "
"o bazi podatkov bo vnaprej izpolnjena z obstoječimi podatki, razen gesla. "
"Drugih podatkov ne smete spreminjati."

#: ../installation/update.rst:62
#: fab1bbf021c04dda8cce55d1aa50db63
msgid "Note it is important that database name and prefixed used in previous database correspond to configuration."
msgstr ""
"Upoštevajte, da je pomembno, da ime baze podatkov in predpona, uporabljena v "
"prejšnji bazi podatkov, ustrezata konfiguraciji."

#: ../installation/update.rst:65
#: be706b5e535a48ea88ebb5ce1915865c
msgid "Previous version selection"
msgstr "Izbira prejšnje različice"

#: ../installation/update.rst:67
#: 6849b68439e84e7d990fb7fd124c50a2
msgid "Next step is the choice of the previous Galette version. Installation process will try to \"guess\" what version it as, and will select this one per default (the one that will be displayed as bold text)."
msgstr ""
"Naslednji korak je izbira prejšnje različice Galette. Namestitveni proces bo "
"poskušal \"uganiti\", za katero različico gre, in jo bo privzeto izbral "
"(tisto, ki bo prikazana kot krepko besedilo)."

#: ../installation/update.rst:73
#: 2b6e7e7304b34dafac2f805cf87a0fea
msgid "If you try to update but your database version seems already correct, you will be warned. No entry will be displayed as bold text, please make sure to choose the right one:"
msgstr ""
"Če poskušate posodobiti, vendar se zdi, da je vaša različica baze podatkov "
"že pravilna, boste opozorjeni. Noben vnos ne bo prikazan s krepko pisavo, "
"zato se prepričajte, da izberete pravilno različico:"

#: ../installation/update.rst:79
#: 7062e651fd5f46b3a5ab89485cff2f2c
msgid "Once update scripts have run, a summary will be displayed."
msgstr "Ko se posodobitveni skripti zaženejo, se prikaže povzetek."
